message: "If you use MacroStress in academic work, cite it as below."
title: "MacroStress: portfolio stress testing over macroeconomic scenarios"
abstract: "An MCP server that builds a consistent macroeconomic scenario with a BVAR, translates it into driver paths with satellite models, and reports the distribution of portfolio losses."
